相片。（IG@yifei_cc）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉亦菲本人在社交平台發布分享的相片。（IG@yifei_cc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250917/1044942167552036864794253.jpeg/qX1sh-4-K4GDMw0V-mmIhs3Sqd8eiylJfcfRZX3H0WU\"/><figcaption>劉亦菲本人在社交平台發布分享的相片。（IG@yifei_cc）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉亦菲本人在社交平台發布分享的相片。（IG@yifei_cc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250917/1044942172400914432807652.jpeg/d9kSAr5WRJhR_xNbFKZlkCGbWGPhyHKJiATjwogE48I\"/><figcaption>劉亦菲本人在社交平台發布分享的相片。（IG@yifei_cc）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉亦菲本人在社交平台發布分享的相片。（IG@yifei_cc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250917/1044942170181996544105893.jpeg/Qa12Wh9RCckNHeR5mdfU0QULlM9oOuUvUPhyTVD4ck0\"/><figcaption>劉亦菲本人在社交平台發布分享的相片。（IG@yifei_cc）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉亦菲本人在社交平台發布分享的相片。（IG@yifei_cc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250917/1044942172723875840809264.jpeg/yECa-PPPnevlbsEjAOwKwbvY5TNh9S0sGQrzMBkK8zA\"/><figcaption>劉亦菲本人在社交平台發布分享的相片。（IG@yifei_cc）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲《聯合早報》授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T15:39:52.028661+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1994,"images":42,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}